.TH PICKDNS 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.6.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pickdns \- serve location-dependent DNS data
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pickdns
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serves the compiled pickdns database over UDP and TCP, selecting answers
according to the client address.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DATA
Database path (default: data.cdb).
.TP
.B IP, PORT
Listen address and port (defaults: 0.0.0.0 and 53).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pickdns-data (1),
.BR pickdns-conf (1)
